              X / Twitter <span class="ext-arrow">&nearr;</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/punit05" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link">
              LinkedIn <span class="ext-arrow">&nearr;</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://farcaster.xyz/0x9899" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link">
              Farcaster <span class="ext-arrow">&nearr;</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.builderbase.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link">
